<title>USA: SmarTalk to sell cards in Staples.</title>
<headline>SmarTalk to sell cards in Staples.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmarTalk TeleServices Inc said Monday it had signed an agreement to sell its prepaid long distance telephone cards in more than 500 Staples Inc office supply stores in the United States.</p>
<p>SmarTalk also announced a new distribution pact with North Carolina-based Mutual Wholesale Drug Co, a distributor to roughly 350 stores.</p>
